+| Original source row | Search nodes | Witness actions | Supported turn fields checked | Unsupported turn fields |
+| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
+| 2 | 22 | 22 | 14 | 8 |
+| 3 | 22 | 22 | 15 | 8 |
